Package: a3-canvas
Version: 0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rafjagger
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, systemd
Description: A³ Canvas, the A³ rig on one screen
 One window with a tile per A³ program (Core and its engine, the StemDeck
 decks, the desk, Motion UI, the beat-analyzer): its state from systemd, dpkg
 and Core, and Start, Stop and Restart through systemctl --user, in the rig's
 order. It never runs as root. `a3-canvas --demo` shows a made-up rig.
